  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two containers X and Y are filled with the same ideal gas and connected by a tube of negligible volume. The volume of X is twice the volume of Y.</p>\n<p>X is held at a temperature of 150 K and Y is held at a temperature of 300 K.</p>\n<p>What is  <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{mass of gas in X}}{\\textit{mass of gas in Y}}\"></span> ?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\">1</li><li data-label=\"C\">2</li><li data-label=\"D\">4</li></ol>"
  },
